WEBVTT

00:01:53.869 --> 00:01:55.667
I'll go on ahead!

00:01:55.737 --> 00:01:56.966
Master Spark!

00:01:57.039 --> 00:02:01.340
Damn! We've got a captain
who's really worth protecting!

00:02:28.103 --> 00:02:30.765
"Dark power, come to my hand!"

00:02:42.751 --> 00:02:45.015
Uh-oh... I'm surrounded.

00:02:50.225 --> 00:02:52.660
| can't die like this!

00:03:07.075 --> 00:03:08.907
Captain!

00:03:16.718 --> 00:03:19.278
"Tiny, invisible spirits..."

00:03:19.354 --> 00:03:21.015
You're not using any magic!

00:03:25.327 --> 00:03:26.988
You won't get away!

00:03:34.402 --> 00:03:37.531
We've finally found them!
I'm not letting them escape now!

00:03:54.222 --> 00:03:56.987
That's it! Will you give
the crystal ball back now?!

00:03:57.325 --> 00:03:59.054
"Tiny, invisible spirits,
let my form become your form!"

00:03:59.127 --> 00:04:01.186
Spark! He's casting a spell!

00:04:05.433 --> 00:04:06.798
Spark!

00:04:08.570 --> 00:04:09.969
Damn it!

00:04:11.039 --> 00:04:14.532
Something's wrong.
I'm sure they ran this way.

00:04:14.609 --> 00:04:17.135
Watch out. They've made
themselves invisible!

00:04:28.023 --> 00:04:30.219
I sense them...
| sense their presence.

00:04:30.292 --> 00:04:32.886
They're definitely close by.

00:04:35.530 --> 00:04:38.659
But where? Where?!

00:04:39.801 --> 00:04:40.996
Ryna!

00:04:48.610 --> 00:04:51.636
"Tiny, invisible spirits,
let my form become your form!"

00:04:51.713 --> 00:04:53.681
You son of a...!

00:04:54.950 --> 00:04:56.076
Ryna!

00:04:56.718 --> 00:04:58.846
Ryna! Speak to me! Ryna!

00:05:02.390 --> 00:05:05.553
Damn you...
Show yourself, Dark EIf!

00:05:09.264 --> 00:05:11.926
Just cut it out and
come out already!

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:15.026
I know you're using magic
to make yourself invisible.

00:05:19.808 --> 00:05:24.006
Okay then, I've got some
bright ideas of my own...

00:05:24.446 --> 00:05:27.177
"Spirits of water,
answer my command!"

00:05:27.249 --> 00:05:29.616
"Come to me and become my power!"

00:05:38.660 --> 00:05:41.459
Damn it! Where are you?!
Come out and face me!

00:06:10.058 --> 00:06:12.254
A protection spell? But who...?

00:06:22.404 --> 00:06:24.133
Aldo!

00:06:24.205 --> 00:06:26.401
"Myrii, great god of war!"

00:06:26.474 --> 00:06:30.707
"Hear my prayer and grant us
the source of your power!"

00:06:31.379 --> 00:06:35.543
"Send that power into my hand,
into my axe, and be released!"

00:06:47.796 --> 00:06:49.389
You did it, Spark!

00:06:49.464 --> 00:06:52.399
Yeah... Somehow...

00:06:52.467 --> 00:06:56.267
Take care of things here, Priest.
I'm worried about the others.

00:06:56.338 --> 00:06:57.237
Right. Get going!

00:06:57.305 --> 00:06:58.363
Yes, sir!

00:07:05.714 --> 00:07:08.149
We should go as well.

00:07:08.216 --> 00:07:09.684
I- Lady Neese!

00:07:28.336 --> 00:07:29.826
Damn it!

00:07:42.751 --> 00:07:46.551
Damn it, don't take a
mercenary from Flaim lightly!

00:08:02.270 --> 00:08:03.965
There you are!

00:08:07.809 --> 00:08:09.777
If you're gonna make
yourself invisible...

00:08:09.844 --> 00:08:12.438
...you gotta hide your presence,
not just your body!

00:08:17.752 --> 00:08:19.151
Garrack!

00:08:20.855 --> 00:08:22.721
You all right, Garrack?!

00:08:22.791 --> 00:08:25.954
I'm fine. But Ryna"s...

00:08:27.295 --> 00:08:29.093
Ryna!

00:08:31.065 --> 00:08:32.499
She's still breathing!

00:08:32.567 --> 00:08:34.968
Somebody, call the priest!

00:08:36.070 --> 00:08:38.095
Please leave this to me.

00:08:38.173 --> 00:08:39.607
Are you all right?

00:08:41.209 --> 00:08:46.272
"Marfa, mother of the earth.
Heal this person's wounds."

00:08:48.883 --> 00:08:50.146
Spark.

00:08:50.218 --> 00:08:52.016
Priest!

00:08:52.187 --> 00:08:56.090
| searched around, but none
of the three we killed...

00:08:56.157 --> 00:08:58.592
...seem to have the crystal ball.

00:08:58.660 --> 00:09:02.028
| see. Then maybe the
one Leaf went after...

00:09:03.231 --> 00:09:04.995
Leaf! Where's Leaf?!

00:09:05.066 --> 00:09:06.932
| came up empty, too.

00:09:07.001 --> 00:09:08.196
Hi.

00:09:08.536 --> 00:09:12.268
Leaf! Thank heaven you're all
right! I was worried about you.

00:09:12.340 --> 00:09:14.638
Liar! You forgot all about me.

00:09:14.943 --> 00:09:18.675
Quite a feat, beating a
Dark EIf singlehanded.

00:09:18.746 --> 00:09:21.943
How'd you find them
when they were invisible?

00:09:22.050 --> 00:09:23.609
Oh, that was simple.

00:09:37.265 --> 00:09:39.461
I see.

00:09:40.168 --> 00:09:43.001
The crystal ball isn't here!
That's impossible!

00:09:43.071 --> 00:09:45.335
I've heard things about this.

00:09:46.374 --> 00:09:48.570
Among thieves, the ones
who steal something...

00:09:48.643 --> 00:09:50.975
...usually don't
keep carrying it around.

00:09:51.045 --> 00:09:52.706
| think they may have already...

00:09:52.780 --> 00:09:55.442
...passed the crystal ball
on to someone else.

00:09:55.517 --> 00:09:58.009
No, that's...
Then what about these guys?

00:09:58.086 --> 00:10:01.181
Decoys, meant
to lead us on a chase.

00:10:02.357 --> 00:10:04.792
And... And I fell for it...

00:10:15.637 --> 00:10:19.096
| see. Well done, Spark.

00:10:19.173 --> 00:10:23.201
Don't look so sad. You may not
have recovered the treasure...

00:10:23.278 --> 00:10:25.076
...but you took care
of the thieves very well.

00:10:25.246 --> 00:10:26.680
You should be proud of that.

00:10:26.748 --> 00:10:31.083
But until I recover the crystal
ball, our mission isn't complete.

00:10:31.886 --> 00:10:34.878
Because I was tricked
into killing the thieves...

00:10:34.956 --> 00:10:37.084
...we don't know
where the crystal is now.

00:10:38.026 --> 00:10:40.757
Why don't we send out riders
to get information from Akroyd?

00:10:40.828 --> 00:10:43.923
Of course, I'll contact the
city's defense forces as well.

00:10:43.998 --> 00:10:46.262
The thieves may have been a decoy...

00:10:46.334 --> 00:10:49.099
...but the possibility's still
strong that they passed...

00:10:49.170 --> 00:10:52.333
...the treasure on somewhere
in the desert near Hiruto.

00:10:52.740 --> 00:10:56.267
Somebody out there
may have seen something.

00:10:57.312 --> 00:10:59.178
Anyhow, get some rest for today.

00:10:59.247 --> 00:11:01.511
We'll eventually get
some information.

00:11:02.350 --> 00:11:03.283
Yes, sir.

00:11:19.867 --> 00:11:23.201
And now that man
has one of the keys...

00:11:24.872 --> 00:11:26.840
Yes? Come in.

00:11:27.609 --> 00:11:29.839
So, how's she doing?

00:11:29.911 --> 00:11:33.211
She's through the worst of it,
but she's still unconscious.

00:11:37.418 --> 00:11:39.386
You must be tired.
I'll watch her now.

00:11:39.454 --> 00:11:41.650
Why don't you get some rest?

00:11:41.723 --> 00:11:43.953
There's some food
ready if you want it.

00:11:44.025 --> 00:11:46.460
| see. Thank you.

00:11:58.673 --> 00:12:01.768
What should I do from here on?

00:12:01.843 --> 00:12:05.609
Do what Governor Randal says
and wait here for news?

00:12:05.680 --> 00:12:08.775
No, the odds are too
low to count on that.

00:12:10.118 --> 00:12:12.246
Maybe give up on finding
the crystal ball for now...

00:12:12.320 --> 00:12:15.085
...and complete my other mission
of getting His Highness's...

00:12:15.156 --> 00:12:17.124
...message to Valis?

00:12:18.893 --> 00:12:20.691
But, if I do that...

00:12:23.197 --> 00:12:26.167
Wh- Where am I...?

00:12:27.735 --> 00:12:30.363
Thank goodness!
You're finally awake.

00:12:30.438 --> 00:12:32.065
Spark...?

00:12:32.140 --> 00:12:34.131
You're in Governor
Randal's mansion.

00:12:36.077 --> 00:12:38.910
But how?! I remember being...!

00:12:38.980 --> 00:12:44.282
Neese used a healing spell on you.
You don't even have any scars.

00:12:45.687 --> 00:12:47.849
Anyway, just get some rest.

00:12:47.922 --> 00:12:50.584
It'll be a while before you
get your strength back.

00:12:51.492 --> 00:12:54.484
You're a very kind man, Spark.

00:12:54.562 --> 00:12:57.725
It's a knight's duty
to be kind to ladies.

00:12:58.466 --> 00:12:59.433
Even knights in training?

00:12:59.634 --> 00:13:00.726
Even knights in training.

00:13:02.537 --> 00:13:05.006
I'll tell the others
you're awake now.

00:13:05.073 --> 00:13:07.508
Everyone's been
worried about you.

00:13:08.676 --> 00:13:09.905
Wait!

00:13:11.179 --> 00:13:14.979
There's something...
Something I have to tell you.

00:13:16.951 --> 00:13:20.683
What I told you about my
being a mercenary wasn't true.

00:13:20.755 --> 00:13:23.224
The fact is..I'm a thief.

00:13:24.192 --> 00:13:26.024
A thief?!

00:13:26.094 --> 00:13:28.153
I'm sorry for tricking you.

00:13:28.229 --> 00:13:34.396
But if the thieves' guild in Blade
learned I told an outsider-...

00:13:34.469 --> 00:13:36.528
...they'd mark me for death.

00:13:37.205 --> 00:13:39.299
That's why ...

00:13:40.541 --> 00:13:44.808
But my wanting to avenge Randy is
the truth! Please believe me!

00:13:47.849 --> 00:13:50.716
80, do you think any less of me now?

00:13:51.753 --> 00:13:56.247
It's not a job to be proud of.
Being someone who steals...

00:13:57.191 --> 00:13:58.716
Better that than
being a murderer!

00:14:00.361 --> 00:14:04.389
Not everyone in this world
is as lucky as you were!

00:14:04.465 --> 00:14:07.560
If they don't cheat others
or steal from others...

00:14:07.635 --> 00:14:10.036
...there's no way for
some people to survive!

00:14:10.705 --> 00:14:14.198
So, what will
you do with me now?

00:14:14.275 --> 00:14:17.802
Tell me to leave? Or maybe
have me thrown in prison?

00:14:17.879 --> 00:14:20.143
| wasn't planning to do either.

00:14:20.214 --> 00:14:23.479
If it's all right with you, I was
hoping you'd stay on with us.

00:14:24.185 --> 00:14:25.653
Wha...?

00:14:25.720 --> 00:14:30.681
But I can't force you. And you
may risk your life again.

00:14:31.526 --> 00:14:34.291
But I'm going to
need you to help find...

00:14:34.362 --> 00:14:36.330
...whoever they passed
the crystal ball onto.

00:14:39.634 --> 00:14:42.331
Wha- What is it?

00:14:42.403 --> 00:14:47.307
You need me because I'm a thief.
Is that really the only reason?

00:14:48.109 --> 00:14:52.603
Well, uh...! You've made
friends with us, too, so...

00:14:52.680 --> 00:14:56.116
You could at least stay with
us till my mission's over!

00:14:56.551 --> 00:14:59.077
I see... How lovely.

00:14:59.320 --> 00:15:02.415
Um, anyway, I'll tell the others!

00:15:18.539 --> 00:15:20.701
Whoa! That's good stuff!

00:15:24.812 --> 00:15:28.771
Nothing tastes better
than a meal after a mission!

00:15:34.889 --> 00:15:37.620
| won't let you...! Whoa!

00:15:42.430 --> 00:15:43.989
Captain?

00:15:47.501 --> 00:15:50.493
What's wrong, Spark?
Is Ryna all right?

00:15:50.571 --> 00:15:54.838
Yeah. She's awake now.
| wanted to tell you all.

00:15:54.909 --> 00:15:56.138
Oh ho...

00:15:56.210 --> 00:15:57.700
Wh- What is it, Leaf?

00:15:57.778 --> 00:15:59.371
Captain, you're blushing.

00:15:59.881 --> 00:16:01.781
Y- You're imagining things!

00:16:01.849 --> 00:16:03.010
Oh, am |?

00:16:03.484 --> 00:16:06.977
Well, I was worried for a while,
but now I see I needn't be.

00:16:07.521 --> 00:16:08.545
Lady Neese?

00:16:08.623 --> 00:16:12.389
I'm going to bring Miss Ryna
something good to eat.

00:16:12.460 --> 00:16:15.657
Her wounds may be healed,
but she still lost a lot of blood.

00:16:15.730 --> 00:16:17.323
What she needs
now is nourishment.

00:16:22.336 --> 00:16:25.033
Quite a girl, isn't she?
Really young, but still...

00:16:25.106 --> 00:16:27.507
No kidding! Always really calm.

00:16:27.575 --> 00:16:30.306
Not like our captain here at all!

00:16:30.378 --> 00:16:31.846
Sh- Shut up!

00:17:15.756 --> 00:17:23.756
"Ladeura rudora del Neese!
Ladeura rudora del Neese!"

00:17:25.232 --> 00:17:28.532
"Destohl dartu har ridees!"

00:17:28.602 --> 00:17:32.698
"Hidota sura-thrill dees!”

00:17:34.141 --> 00:17:37.133
I've been waiting for you, Doorway.

00:17:42.483 --> 00:17:44.884
You're... Wagnard!

00:17:45.286 --> 00:17:50.122
Ah, I see you remember me.
I am honored.

00:17:52.927 --> 00:17:55.294
How dare you invade
my mind like this...

00:17:57.698 --> 00:18:00.793
Just what are you
trying to do, Wagnard?!

00:18:00.868 --> 00:18:03.633
Trying to revive Kardis
the Destroyer...

00:18:03.704 --> 00:18:06.002
Do you want to destroy the world?!

00:18:06.941 --> 00:18:09.911
Your feelings on the matter
are beside the point.

00:18:09.977 --> 00:18:15.677
What I want, Neese, is your
body to serve as the doorway.

00:18:15.750 --> 00:18:20.153
Now, won't you come with
me to the dark island?

00:18:21.489 --> 00:18:24.754
I refuse! I have no
intention of helping you!

00:18:45.413 --> 00:18:48.144
Neese! What's wrong?!
Open the door! Neese!

00:18:48.215 --> 00:18:49.376
What's wrong?!

00:18:49.450 --> 00:18:51.578
| don't know! It's locked!

00:18:52.053 --> 00:18:54.112
I'll handle this!
Everyone, stand back!

00:18:56.824 --> 00:18:57.916
Wait!

00:19:17.411 --> 00:19:18.970
Wh- What's going on?!

00:19:26.687 --> 00:19:28.052
Neese...

00:19:43.871 --> 00:19:46.135
Welcome to Lodoss Island!

00:19:46.207 --> 00:19:48.801
And now, what you've been waiting
for, the second part of the show!

00:19:54.515 --> 00:19:55.983
H- Help!

00:20:00.254 --> 00:20:01.653
Spark, do something!

00:20:01.722 --> 00:20:03.212
Um, that's easy to say, but...

00:20:03.290 --> 00:20:04.985
Hurry up and kill it!

00:20:05.092 --> 00:20:06.992
G- Gotcha...

00:20:08.462 --> 00:20:11.898
How did we ever wander
into a black dragon's dungeon?

00:20:13.000 --> 00:20:15.662
Why does this have
to happen to me?!

00:20:26.180 --> 00:20:28.740
They've fallen into my trap.

00:20:29.250 --> 00:20:30.945
Ta-daa!

00:20:37.158 --> 00:20:39.525
Now, take care of them,
Black Dragon!

00:20:44.798 --> 00:20:46.732
How am I supposed to fight it?!

00:20:50.204 --> 00:20:51.535
A treasure chest?

00:20:51.605 --> 00:20:55.098
I hear you can find magic
items scattered around dungeons.

00:20:55.176 --> 00:20:57.270
Maybe we can use it
against the black dragon!

00:20:57.344 --> 00:20:58.436
Let's check it out!

00:20:58.512 --> 00:21:01.482
Little Dragon, we need you to
distract him for a while. Get going!

00:21:05.452 --> 00:21:06.920
Here we go... Huh?

00:21:06.987 --> 00:21:08.785
It's a legendary magic item!

00:21:11.659 --> 00:21:13.388
Hold it right there!

00:21:14.461 --> 00:21:17.624
I shall destroy you!
With the legendary magic item...

00:21:17.698 --> 00:21:19.188
...the wig of Aphro!

00:21:22.670 --> 00:21:24.729
What's so funny?! Come on!

00:21:31.011 --> 00:21:32.604
I... 1| won...

00:21:33.380 --> 00:21:35.747
But why do I feel so empty inside?

00:22:59.466 --> 00:23:02.060
We're suddenly
attacked by an evil storm!

00:23:02.136 --> 00:23:06.334
Into its dark power is
swept Neese's body!

00:23:06.407 --> 00:23:09.570
Could this be the dark
nightmare she spoke of ?!

00:23:09.643 --> 00:23:13.705
To save the suffering girl,
we must fight an invisible enemy!

00:23:14.581 --> 00:23:17.983
Next time, on Record of Lodoss War -
Chronicles of the Heroic Knight:

00:23:18.052 --> 00:23:19.918
"Doorway... The Truth Proclaimed."
